{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8cbd6006945d280a623","chatId":"6ae6f28b506d44f4ae0855cc7cbf9d9b","sessionId":null,"userId":68839,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":877,"promptTokens":1583,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:19"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005218062655254893,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8cbd6006945d280a622","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369739482,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:19","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8cbd6006945d280a622","chatId":"6ae6f28b506d44f4ae0855cc7cbf9d9b","sessionId":null,"userId":68839,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n在去日本的旅行过程中，小洁去了一家好评很多的寿司餐厅。她给自己点了很多菜，吃到很饱。她要了发票并且给了慷慨地一笔20美元的小费。但服务员看到小费后把它还给了小洁\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小洁最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 开心 & 惊讶\nB) 反对 & 惊讶\nC) 反对 & 反感\nD) 反对 & 尴尬\nE) 期待 & 反对\nF) 尴尬 & 惊讶\n\n## 问题 2\n小洁为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她不明白女服务员为什么要退回小费 & 小洁认识这个女服务员，她们在高中时是同学。\nB) 女服务员退回了她的小费，这可能意味着她给的小费不够 & 她不明白女服务员为什么要退回小费\nC) 女服务员对她的态度很粗鲁 & 小洁认识这个女服务员，她们在高中时是同学。\nD) 小洁忘记给女服务员小费 & 食物比她预期的要好\nE) 她不明白女服务员为什么要退回小费 & 小洁意识到她把钱包忘在了酒店\nF) 她不明白女服务员为什么要退回小费 & 女服务员对她的态度很粗鲁","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005218062655254893,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8cbd6006945d280a623","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369739479,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:19","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"567cc5bbe43c40668213cdbbcc885c47"}